    "section_faq_XeGrmV": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "block_tak6ta": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What should I consider before taking this product?",
            "text": "<p>Before using this product it is recommenced to consult your healthcare professional. If you are taking any medications, it’s important to discuss potential interactions with your healthcare provider. Do not use if tamper seal is damaged.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_3MVhQ7": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is this product manufactured and what product quality control tests are performed?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 products are manufactured in Nevada in a state-of-the-art, FDA-registered facility that meets or exceeds <a href=\"https://www.fda.gov/drugs/pharmaceutical-quality-resources/facts-about-current-good-manufacturing-practice-cgmp#:~:text=What%20is%20CGMP%3F,of%20manufacturing%20processes%20and%20facilities.\">current Good Manufacturing Practices (cGMP)</a>. Quality control testing is carried out at each stage of the manufacturing process, starting with rigorous raw material assessments and continuing through to finished product testing. </p><p><strong>Our BPC-157 supplements are third-party tested by ISO certified, FDA registered laboratories for purity, potency and contaminates.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "block_AKtNdP": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Apeiron Elementals BPC 157 third-party verified?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our BPC-157 products are third-party tested for purity, quality and consistency.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_xfGnzX": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between BPC-157 Prime and your other BPC-157 products?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 Prime includes a highly bioavailable form of curcumin, called tetrahydrocurcumin. This combination offers additional benefits including: Improved acetylcholine production and protection, a more balanced inflammatory response from powerful antioxidant properties, and support of a healthy lipid profile.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_caxTCm": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should I take this on an empty stomach or with food?",
            "text": "<p>Our BPC-157 supplement remains stable in gastric juice. However, some reports suggest that the absorption of BPC-157 is enhanced when taken on an empty stomach.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_LG8HAK": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What other supplements work synergistically with this product?",
            "text": "<p>BPC-157 works well alongside most other dietary supplements. Our favorite adds are TB4-Frag, Marine Collagen, High Potency EPA+DHA and Magnesium Glycinate. All of which can support recovery, repair and optimize resilience.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_4XQyf9": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this product vegan?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our BPC-157 products are also formulated without gluten, dairy, and soy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_V7dCWj": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are BPC 157 capsules bioavailable?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. Many peptides lack stability and must be administered subcutaneously. However, BPC-157 is one of the few peptides that is stable in the digestive system, making it effective when taken orally. BPC-157 was identified as bioavailable being naturally present in human gastric juices. Our dosage of 500mcg per capsule offers similar benefits without the need for injections.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block_RMJWmN": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does it typically take to experience the benefits?",
            "text": "<p>With oral BPC-157 arginate salt at 500mcg per day, most users and animal studies report experiencing initial benefits—particularly for gut health, soft tissue injury, or inflammation support—within the first 7–14 days of consistent daily use. Improvements may include reduced pain, better digestion, or faster healing responses. For more substantial or chronic conditions (e.g., tendon injuries or longstanding inflammation), treatments may last 4–6 weeks to see full or peak effects, and some individuals may require longer cycles for maximal benefit. </p>"
          }
        },
        "block_CUzkg9": {
          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you test for lipopolysaccharides or LPS?",
            "text": "<p>Yes! Our product is tested specifically for LPS. Levels have to be &lt;10 EU/mg to pass quality control.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
